g++ -o udp_receiver udp_receiver.cpp -Wall -Wextra
sudo ./udp_receiver
```

Note: For port numbers below 1024, you need root privileges, but since we're using port 888, the `sudo` is not strictly necessary unless your system has specific restrictions.

