- Use `BoxWithConstraints` for simple size-based logic.
- Use `Layout` for full control over measurement and positioning.
- Combine with slot APIs for dynamic content switching.
- Follow Material Design breakpoints for consistency.

This approach mimics CSS container queries by adapting to the available space in Compose.
